        "original_id": "13de604d-233e-5918-b910-cbaa7a0f253a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arturo Beltrán Leyva, Héctor Beltrán Leyva, Edgar Valdez Villarreal\n- Organizations: Beltrán Leyva Cartel, La Barredora\n- Roles: cartel boss, faction leader, right-hand man, suspected drug lord\n\nFacts:\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal was born on August 11, 1973.\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal, also known as La Barbie, is a Mexican American suspected drug lord and a leader of the Beltrán Leyva Cartel, a criminal group based in Sinaloa.\n- Edgar Valdez Villarreal had long been the right hand of Arturo Beltrán Leyva.\n- In December 2009, the Mexican military killed Arturo Beltrán Leyva, the top boss of the cartel.\n- After Arturo Beltrán Leyva was killed in December 2009, his brother Héctor Beltrán Leyva took control of one faction of the Beltrán Leyva Cartel and declared war on Edgar Valdez Villarreal.",
